  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/YfVdywL/aether.png\" alt=\"Aether\"></p>\n<h2>The Aether Legacy 整合包</h2>\n<p>我最初製作這個整合包是為了和朋友一起玩，但似乎有很多人非常喜歡它！</p>\n<p>本整合包加入了 The Aether Legacy，以及為其開發的超棒擴充模組，還有效能與最佳化相關模組。</p>\n<h4>跟我一起玩！</h4>\n<p>我們有一個可供遊玩的伺服器，伺服器 IP 為</p>\n<code>theaether.net</code>\n<h4>包含的模組</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fweb.archive.org%252fweb%252f20230729182335%252fhttps%253a%252f%252fminecraft.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252fthe-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Legacy</a> by Gilded Games：主要模組，用於新增 Aether 維度</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fweb.archive.org%252fweb%252f20230729182335%252fhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252faether-lost-content\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Lost Content (Addon)</a> by ModdingLegacy：超棒的擴充模組，新增了白金迷宮（空鯨之王）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fweb.archive.org%252fweb%252f20230729182335%252fhttps%253a%252f%252fminecraft.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252fbetterfps\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterFps</a> by Guichaguri：有助於提升效能與幀率</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fweb.archive.org%252fweb%252f20230729182335%252fhttps%253a%252f%252fminecraft.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252fcontrolling\" rel=\"nofollow\">Controlling</a> by jaredlll08：為鍵位設定新增搜尋欄</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fweb.archive.org%252fweb%252f20230729182335%252fhttps%253a%252f%252fminecraft.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252ffoamfix-for-minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">FoamFix</a> by asiekierka：減少載入負荷並協助提升效能</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fweb.archive.org%252fweb%252f20230729182335%252fhttps%253a%252f%252fminecraft.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252fhwyla\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hwyla</a> by DatNut：顯示當前視線所對的方塊資訊</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fweb.archive.org%252fweb%252f20230729182335%252fhttps%253a%252f%252fminecraft.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252fphosphor\" rel=\"nofollow\">Phosphor</a> by jellysquid_：極具實用的模組，大幅改善光照渲染與效能</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fweb.archive.org%252fweb%252f20230729182335%252fhttps%253a%252f%252fminecraft.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252fvanillafix\" rel=\"nofollow\">VanillaFix</a> by Runemoro 與 ZombieHDGaming：可防止遊戲崩潰並協助提升效能</li>\n</ul>",
